  "title": "Josie's Lonely Hearts Club",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "JOSIE'S LONELY HEARTS CLUB is a semi-scripted audio drama set in the best relationship call-in show in the greater New Mexico broadcast region. &nbsp; On-air, Josie mends the broken hearts of a weekly collection of hilarious improvisers. Off-air, listeners eavesdrop on Josie&rsquo;s secret identity: hapless, neurotic Joanne Holtzinger. Join Joanne and her puckish producer Frank as they navigate the pitfalls of love and fame as their show slowly becomes a national sensation.&nbsp; &nbsp; Night night, cuties. &nbsp; Created by Maximilian Clark and Rachel Music. Story editors Aliza Brugger, Jenny Snyder, and Lauren Grace Thompson. &nbsp; Directed by Maximilian Clark. &nbsp; Starring Rachel Music as Joanne Holtzinger and Maximilian Clark as Frank. &nbsp; Featuring a diverse cast of voices and talents. See episode details for more information. &nbsp; Produced by Simone Kisiel and Alexandra Grunberg. Executive produced by the Good Story Guild. &nbsp; JOSIE'S LONELY HEARTS CLUB is brought to you by the Good Story Guild . Keep track of us on Instagram @goodstoryguild , join our Discord , and support us on Patreon for ad-free episodes, early access to future episodes, and bonus content. &nbsp; If you enjoyed the show, consider leaving a rating and/or review on your preferred podcast listening platform.",
